  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Bow, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Our Community   \t\t\t \n     Doing Business in Bow   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\nHome \nGovernment \nDepartments \nTown Clerk & Tax Collector \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\n9 \n1 \n1 \n2 \t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\nThe State of New Hampshire requires all dogs be registered by April 30th of each year. In order to avoid fines, please remember to register your dogs before the end of April. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Genealogical / Historical Research \r\nBirth records prior to 1912 and death, marriage and divorce records prior to 1962 are available with unrestricted access. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Hunting & Fishing Licensing \r\nHunting and fishing licenses are available through the Town of Bow Town Clerk's office. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Motor Vehicles \r\nHere you can access all your motor vehicle renewal options, transferring title, titles, forms, new residents, and boats and off highway recreational vehicles.  \nNH RSA HB 391 requires a current photo identification be presented to the town clerk for ALL Motor Vehicle transactions. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Vital Records \r\nHere you will find information about our vital records like birth, death, and marriage certificates. \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tMridula Naik\r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nEmail  \r\nTown Clerk & Tax Collector Department \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t 10 Grandview Road \n\t\t\t\t\t Bow ,  NH   03304 \r\nPhone:  603-223-3980 \r\nFax: 603-225-5428 \r\nHours:  Monday - Friday, 7:30 a.m. - 4:00 p.m., (excluding  Town Holidays ) \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t\t\tTammy Martin\r\nAssistant Town Clerk - Tax Collector \r\nEmail Tammy Martin  \r\nMore Information \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Genealogical / Historical Research \r\n\t\t\t Hunting & Fishing Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicles \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t\t Birth Records \r\n\t\t\t\t Death Certificates \r\n\t\t\t\t Divorce Records \r\n\t\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Permitting \r\n\t\t\t Elections and Town Meeting \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me® \r\n\t\t\t GIS & Tax Maps \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Bow \n10 Grandview Road \nBow, NH 03304 \nPhone:  603-223-3900 \nStaff Directory \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Baker Free Library \n         Bow Schools \n         Employment Opportunities \n         Motor Vehicle Registration \n         Parks and Recreation \n         Send Us Comments \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Site Map \n         Mission \n         Accessibility \n         Privacy \n         Copyright Notices \n         Powered by CivicPlus® \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n     Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
